<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>037Studio & PhotoBooth System</title>

    <!-- App Icon & Favicon -->
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13URW3wYnrYhy0aHzrwHG5Xx83pvcyBvL">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13URW3wYnrYhy0aHzrwHG5Xx83pvcyBvL">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13URW3wYnrYhy0aHzrwHG5Xx83pvcyBvL">
    
    <!-- iOS Web App Configurations -->
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="037Studio">

    <!-- Tailwind CSS & Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest" defer></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');
        body { 
            font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif; 
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .no-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }

        /* TAB NAVIGATION ANIMATIONS */
        .tab-indicator {
            transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        .tab-item {
            transition: all 0.25s ease-out;
        }
        .tab-item.active {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .tab-item.active i {
            transform: scale(1.15);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 pb-24 min-h-screen">

    <!-- STANDALONE PUBLIC RECEIPT VIEW -->
    <div id="standaloneReceipt" class="hidden min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-slate-100">
        <div class="bg-white w-full max-w-md rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-xl space-y-4 border border-slate-200" id="standaloneReceiptCard">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13URW3wYnrYhy0aHzrwHG5Xx83pvcyBvL" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-amber-500/30">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base leading-tight">037Studio</h3>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-600 font-semibold">ใบสรุปยืนยันการจองออนไลน์</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[9px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 font-mono" id="stRecBookingNo">#BOOKING</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-amber-950 text-white p-4 rounded-2xl text-center space-y-1 shadow-md">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-300 font-medium block">⏰ เวลาเข้าใช้บริการ / นัดหมาย</span>
                <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-400 tracking-tight" id="stRecTime">00:00 - 00:00 น.</div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-200" id="stRecDate">DD-MM-YYYY</div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-50 pb-1.5">
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">ชื่อลูกค้า:</span>
                    <strong class="text-slate-800" id="stRecCustName">-</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-50 pb-1.5">
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">เบอร์โทรศัพท์:</span>
                    <strong class="text-slate-800 font-mono" id="stRecCustPhone">-</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-50 pb-1.5">
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">แพ็กเกจ/บริการ:</span>
                    <strong class="text-slate-800 text-right max-w-[200px]" id="stRecPackage">-</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-50 pb-1.5" id="stRecLocationRow">
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">โน้ต/คำอธิบาย:</span>
                    <strong class="text-slate-800 text-right max-w-[200px]" id="stRecLocation">-</strong>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="stRecHistoryRow" class="hidden bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 text-indigo-900 p-3 rounded-2xl text-xs space-y-0.5">
                <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1 text-indigo-700">
                    <i data-lucide="history" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                    <span>ประวัติการปรับเลื่อนวัน/เวลา:</span>
                </div>
                <div id="stRecHistoryText" class="text-[11px] font-mono text-indigo-800 whitespace-pre-line pl-4"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1.5 text-xs">
                <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-600">
                    <span>ยอดบริการรวมทั้งหมด:</span>
                    <strong class="text-slate-900 text-sm" id="stRecTotalAmt">฿0.00</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between text-emerald-600 font-medium">
                    <span>ชำระมัดจำแล้ว:</span>
                    <strong id="stRecDepositAmt" class="text-sm">฿0.00</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between text-amber-700 font-bold border-t border-slate-200 pt-2 text-base">
                    <span>คงเหลือชำระหน้างาน:</span>
                    <span id="stRecBalanceAmt">฿0.00</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-center text-xs font-semibold space-y-0.5">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                    <i data-lucide="camera" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600"></i>
                    <span>แคปหน้าจอเพื่อยื่นให้พนักงานที่ร้าน</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-normal">*กรุณามาถึงก่อนเวลาประมาณ 10-15 นาที ขอบพระคุณที่ใช้บริการ 037Studio ครับ</p>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-1">
                <button onclick="shareStandaloneReceipt()" class="w-full py-3 bg-slate-900 text-amber-400 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold active:scale-95 transition flex justify-center items-center gap-2 shadow-md">
                    <i data-lucide="share-2" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span>📲 แชร์ใบจองให้เพื่อน</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN APP WRAPPER -->
    <div id="mainAdminApp">
        <!-- Top App Bar -->
        <header class="bg-slate-900 text-white sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-md">
            <div class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex justify-between items-center">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-amber-500/50 bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-inner">
                        <img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/13URW3wYnrYhy0aHzrwHG5Xx83pvcyBvL" 
                             alt="037Studio Logo" 
                             class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                             onerror="this.onerror=null; this.parentElement.innerHTML='<i data-lucide=\'camera\' class=\'w-5 h-5 text-amber-500\'></i>'; renderIcons();">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <h1 class="font-bold text-base leading-tight" id="appHeaderTitle">037Studio</h1>
                            <span id="badgeStaffMode" class="hidden bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 text-[9px] font-extrabold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">โหมดพนักงาน</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-medium" id="appHeaderSub">ระบบตรวจเช็คยอดจอง & ยอดมัดจำ</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <button onclick="toggleTrashModal(true)" class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-amber-400 hover:bg-slate-700 transition border border-slate-700 relative" title="ถังขยะคิวจอง">
                        <i data-lucide="trash-2" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </button>
                    <button id="btnSettings" onclick="toggleSettingsModal(true)" class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-400 transition border border-slate-700">
                        <i data-lucide="settings" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="syncCalendar()" id="btnSync" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 active:scale-95 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30 p-2.5 rounded-xl transition flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold">
                        <i data-lucide="refresh-cw" class="w-4 h-4" id="iconSync"></i>
                        <span class="hidden sm:inline">ดึงข้อมูล</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Main Container -->
        <main class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 pt-4 space-y-4">

            <!-- OWNER CONTROL PANEL -->
            <div id="ownerShareStaffPanel" class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-3 flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-amber-900 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="user-check" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0"></i>
                    <span><strong>เจ้าของร้าน:</strong> แชร์ลิงก์ให้พนักงานควบคุม</span>
                </div>
                <button onclick="copyStaffModeLink()" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-xl text-[11px] transition shadow-sm shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1">
                    <i data-lucide="copy" class="w-3 h-3"></i>
                    <span>คัดลอกลิงก์</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- HERO DASHBOARD CARD (OWNER VIEW) -->
            <div id="ownerDashboardCard" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-amber-950 rounded-3xl p-5 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
                
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium tracking-wide">ยอดรวมจองวันที่ <span id="displaySelectedDate" class="text-amber-400 font-bold">-</span></span>
                    <span id="valTotalBookings" class="text-[11px] bg-white/10 text-amber-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-medium">0 คิว</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4" id="valTotalSales">฿0.00</div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-white/10 text-xs">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] block">ยอดมัดจำที่ได้รับแล้ว</span>
                        <span id="valTotalDeposit" class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-sm">฿0.00</span>
                        <span id="valDepositCount" class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 block truncate">0 คิวมีมัดจำ</span>
                    </div>
                    <div id="ownerDailyCommContainer" class="border-l border-white/10 pl-3">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] block">คอมมิชชั่นพนักงาน (ประจำวัน)</span>
                        <span id="valDailyCommission" class="font-bold text-amber-400 text-sm">฿0.00</span>
                        <span id="valPendingAmount" class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 block truncate">คงเหลือ ฿0.00</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- MONTHLY COMMISSION AUDIT SUMMARY CARD (ย้ายมาไว้ข้างบนปฏิทิน + พับเก็บได้) -->
            <div id="summaryCardContainer" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-2.5">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5" id="summaryCardHeaderTitle">
                        <i data-lucide="award" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500"></i>
                        สรุปยอดคอมมิชชั่นประจำเดือน (<span id="monthlyLabel">-</span>)
                    </h2>
                    <button onclick="toggleCommissionCollapse()" id="btnCollapseComm" class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 transition flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-bold">
                        <span id="lblCollapseComm">พับเก็บ</span>
                        <i data-lucide="chevron-up" id="iconCollapseComm" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
                
                <div id="commCollapsibleContent">
                    <!-- OWNER VIEW BOXES -->
                    <div id="ownerSummaryBoxes" class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-xs">
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                            <span class="text-slate-500 text-[9px] block truncate">ยอดจองรวม</span>
                            <span id="monthlyTotalSales" class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">฿0.00</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                            <span class="text-slate-500 text-[9px] block truncate">มัดจำรวม</span>
                            <span id="monthlyTotalDeposit" class="font-bold text-emerald-600 text-xs sm:text-sm">฿0.00</span>
                        </div>
                        <div id="ownerCommBox" onclick="toggleCommissionDetailModal(true)" class="bg-amber-50/80 p-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 cursor-pointer hover:bg-amber-100/80 active:scale-95 transition shadow-sm">
                            <span class="text-amber-900 text-[9px] font-bold block truncate flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span>คอมมิชชั่นพนักงาน</span>
                                <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-3 h-3 text-amber-600"></i>
                            </span>
                            <span id="monthlyTotalCommission" class="font-bold text-amber-600 text-xs sm:text-sm">฿0.00</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- STAFF VIEW BOXES (ปรับแก้ตัวอักษรเด่นชัด ปรับโทนสีสวยงาม) -->
                    <div id="staffSummaryBoxes" class="hidden">
                        <div onclick="toggleCommissionDetailModal(true)" 
                             class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-amber-500 to-yellow-500 p-4 rounded-2xl text-slate-950 shadow-md relative overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:brightness-105 active:scale-95 transition border border-amber-300">
                            
                            <!-- Confetti Background Elements -->
                            <div class="absolute -right-3 -top-3 opacity-20 text-4xl select-none">🎉</div>
                            <div class="absolute right-12 bottom-1 opacity-20 text-3xl select-none">✨</div>

                            <div class="space-y-2.5 relative z-10">
                                <!-- Title Header -->
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                    <span class="text-base leading-none">💰</span>
                                    <span class="text-[12px] font-bold text-slate-950 tracking-tight">ยอดรวมคอมมิชชั่นพนักงานเดือนนี้</span>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Big Price & Queue Capsule -->
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
                                    <div class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 drop-shadow-sm" id="staffMonthlyCommissionTotal">฿0.00</div>
                                    
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-950 text-amber-400 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-amber-400/30">
                                        <span class="text-xs font-black" id="staffMonthlyTotalQueues">0 คิว</span>
                                        <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- High Contrast Breakdown Boxes (เด่นชัด กระแทกตา) -->
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-950/20 text-[11px]">
                                    <div class="bg-amber-600/20 p-2 rounded-xl flex justify-between items-center border border-amber-700/30">
                                        <span class="text-slate-950 font-bold">คอมฯ แพ็กเกจ:</span>
                                        <strong class="text-slate-950 font-black text-xs" id="staffBaseCommissionTotal">฿0.00</strong>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="bg-amber-600/20 p-2 rounded-xl flex justify-between items-center border border-amber-700/30">
                                        <span class="text-slate-950 font-bold">โบนัสพิเศษ:</span>
                                        <strong class="text-slate-950 font-black text-xs" id="staffBonusCommissionTotal">+฿0.00</strong>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CALENDAR SECTION CARD -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i data-lucide="calendar" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500"></i>
                        <h2 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900" id="calendarMonthTitle">กำลังโหลด...</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                        <button onclick="changeMonth(-1)" class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 transition">
                            <i data-lucide="chevron-left" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="changeMonth(1)" class="p-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 transition">
                            <i data-lucide="chevron-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        </button>
                        <a id="btnCalendarExternal" href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/1?cid=c2lyaWNob2tsYXBraGFtQGdtYWlsLmNvbQ" target="_blank" class="ml-1 bg-slate-900 text-amber-400 text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1">
                            <i data-lucide="external-link" class="w-3 h-3"></i>
                            <span>ปฏิทิน</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-7 text-center text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-100 pb-1">
                    <div>อา</div><div>จ</div><div>อ</div><div>พ</div><div>พฤ</div><div>ศ</div><div>ส</div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-7 gap-1 text-center text-xs" id="calendarGrid"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Loading Indicator -->
            <div id="loadingIndicator" class="bg-white/90 border border-amber-300 p-3.5 rounded-2xl text-center font-medium text-amber-900 shadow-sm">
                <div class="inline-block animate-spin rounded-full h-4 w-4 border-b-2 border-amber-600 mr-2"></div>
                <span id="loadingText" class="text-xs">กำลังเชื่อมต่อข้อมูลคิวจอง...</span>
            </div>

            <!-- ALERT BANNER -->
            <div id="depositStatusBanner" class="rounded-2xl p-3.5 border transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800">
                <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0"></i>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="font-bold block" id="bannerTitle">สรุปภาพรวมวันที่เลือก</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-600 block" id="bannerSub">เลือกวันที่ในปฏิทินด้านบนเพื่อดูตารางเวลาและยอดมัดจำ</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- BUTTON ADD BOOKING -->
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center px-1">
                <button onclick="toggleAddBookingModal(true)" class="w-full py-3 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 active:scale-95 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-2xl text-xs transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-md">
                    <i data-lucide="calendar-plus" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span>+ กรอกคิวสำหรับลูกค้า Walk in ที่หน้าร้าน</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- BOOKING SCHEDULE LIST CARD -->
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center px-1">
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500"></i>
                        ตารางคิวเรียงตามเวลา (เช้า ➔ เย็น)
                    </h2>
                    <span id="bookingListCount" class="text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-500">0 รายการ</span>
                </div>
                <div id="bookingListContainer" class="space-y-2"></div>
            </div>

        </main>

        <!-- MODAL รายละเอียดสรุปแพ็กเกจคอมมิชชั่นประจำเดือน (ทั้งเจ้าของร้าน & พนักงาน + รายการโบนัสพิเศษ) -->
        <div id="commissionDetailModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="bg-white w-full max-w-md rounded-3xl p-5 shadow-2xl space-y-3.5 max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="award" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500"></i>
                        <span>สรุปคอมมิชชั่นประจำเดือน (<span id="modalCommMonthLabel">-</span>)</span>
                    </h3>
                    <button onclick="toggleCommissionDetailModal(false)" class="p-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-500">
                        <i data-lucide="x" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Top Highlight Card -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-amber-500 to-yellow-500 p-4 rounded-2xl text-slate-950 space-y-2 shadow-md shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden border border-amber-300">
